# Heartfire Hero's valiant triggers "for the first time each turn" (CR 603.2). Turn 1: Bot1 casts the Hero, then Snakeskin Veil
# (a spell Bot1 controls, which puts its own +1/+1 counter on the target) on it: the first targeting this turn, so valiant puts
# a counter on it before the Veil resolves (3 counters... see the checks: 2 after the trigger and the Veil), and a second Veil
# the same turn is not the first time, so only the Veil's own counter arrives (3 counters, a 4/4). Turn 3 is a new turn: a
# third Veil is the first time again, so it gets the Veil's counter plus valiant's (5 counters, a 6/6).

